{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_46","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"fetch","tool":"fetch","arguments":{"max_length":10000,"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ali_Khamenei#International_relations"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Contents of https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ali_Khamenei#International_relations:\n| * [Grand Ayatollah](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_Ayatollah \"Grand Ayatollah\") * [Seyyed](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seyyed \"Seyyed\")  Ali Khamenei | |\n| --- | --- |\n| [A photograph of Khamenei, 77, in 2017](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Ali_Khamenei_Nowruz_message_official_portrait_1397_02_(3_x_4_cropped).jpg) Khamenei in 2017 | |\n|  | |\n| 2nd [Supreme Leader of Iran](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Supreme_Leader_of_Iran \"Supreme Leader of Iran\") | |\n| **In office** 4 June 1989[[a]](#cite_note-1) – 28 February 2026 | |\n| President | *See list*   * + *Himself*   + [Akbar Hashemi Rafsanjani](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Akbar_Hashemi_Rafsanjani \"Akbar Hashemi Rafsanjani\")   + [Mohammad Khatami](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mohammad_Khatami \"Mohammad Khatami\")   + [Mahmoud Ahmadinejad](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mahmoud_Ahmadinejad \"Mahmoud Ahmadinejad\")   + [Hassan Rouhani](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hassan_Rouhani \"Hassan Rouhani\")   + [Ebrahim Raisi](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ebrahim_Raisi \"Ebrahim Raisi\")   + [Mohammad Mokhber](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mohammad_Mokhber \"Mohammad Mokhber\") (acting)   + [Masoud Pezeshkian](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masoud_Pezeshkian \"Masoud Pezeshkian\") |\n| Prime Minister | [Mir-Hossein Mousavi](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mir-Hossein_Mousavi \"Mir-Hossein Mousavi\") (Jun–Aug 1989) |\n| Preceded by | [Ruhollah Khomeini](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ruhollah_Khomeini \"Ruhollah Khomeini\") |\n| Succeeded by | [Mojtaba Khamenei](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mojtaba_Khamenei \"Mojtaba Khamenei\")[[b]](#cite_note-3) |\n| 3rd [President of Ir